OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowery rain
OL,6,Ffor some early this evening, but
OL,7,Fturning generally drier overnight. A
OL,8,Ffew showery bursts are possible later,
OL,9,Fmainly over the hills in the west. The
OL,10,Fwinds will remain blustery making for
OL,11,Fa much milder night than last night.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FA mostly dry day with sunny
OL,14,Fspells developing. The odd blustery
OL,15,Fshower is possible, mainly early in
OL,16,Fthe day. Feeling warm in the sunshine
OL,17,Fand out of the brisk winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
