OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FWinds
OL,6,Feasing as pressure rises to bring a
OL,7,Fsettled period. Lengthy sunny periods
OL,8,Fbut locally chilly nights at first
OL,9,Fwith patchy fog. Turning warmer with
OL,10,Ftemperatures rising above average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
